        <p>COUNTY PALATINE OF CHESTER. • NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN, that the next b GENERAL PUARTER SESSIONS of the ;,.enee for the COUNTY PALATINE OF ES .1-,.'4ITER will be held- at the COURT-HOUSE, 4kNI3TSFORD, in and for the said County, on MONDAY, the 3rd day of APRIL NEXT, at 12.30 o'clock in the Forenoon, when the Grand nrY will be empanelled. pThe hearing of all Appeals arising within the etty Sessional Divisions of Altrincham,, Buck- tw. Dukinfield. Middlewich, Sandbach, Congle- Northwich, Prestbury, and Stockport, °rifling the Knutsford District, and the trials will °f all Prisoners committed from such Divisions toce place at such Sessions. The Grand and -rettY Juries for the Knutsford District m.u.St be 1,11 attenda,nce at the COURT lIOUSE, KNUTS- x"D. at the opening of the Court on lONDAY, the 3r -d d of APRIL NEXT, at 10.30 o'clock in the Forenoon. cat; COURT will be Adjourned to the OF CHESTER on WEDNESDAY, the ItiSl thiy of APRIL NEXT, at•Eleyen o'clock in ne Forenoon. The hearing of all Appeals arising within the Sessional Divisions of Broxton, Chester astle. Daresburr, Eddisbury, Nantwich, Run- • rrn, WinsfOrd, and Wirral, forming the Clies- „ er District, and the trials of all prisoners corn- , ritted from the last-mentioned Divisions will du"?' Place at such Adjourned Sessions. The ra nd And Petty Juries for the Chester District kaIESTP be in attendance at .the CASTLE .OF 'crp --alt at the opening of the Court on at 4DNESDAY, the sth day of APRIL NEXT, Eleven 'C'clock in the ,Ferendon.</p>
        <p>Clerk of the Peace for the County Palatine of -Chester. -Chester, 14th-liarch, 1916.</p>
