      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-03-18_WidnesExaminer_art0027" n="art0027">
        <p>_ .</p>
        <p>LL-STEEL BICYCLE To and from work.</p>
        <p>GUARANTEED FOR EVER Fitted with Dunlop Tyres and Sturmey-Archer Tr-Coaster.</p>
