        <p>simply through lack of something better to do. The egg eating habit may also be contracted. The best form of exercise is provided by bury- ing the grain in the litter. Scratching is the natural and healthiest form of exercise. Automatic feeders are also extremely useful. Keep the birds busy and the ei g g yield will please you.—" The Poultry World."</p>
