        <p>There would be about 1,000 spectators when the following players turned out:— Warrington Town: Kite; Roberts and Leah; Broster, Whitfield and Osborne; Connor, Smith. Henderson, Foster and Cookson.</p>
        <p>Atherton: Ellison; Dunn and Silcock; Smith,</p>
      </div>
